# professor-orb's setup skill copies workflows/*.mjs verbatim into a consumer
# project's .claude/workflows/. On Windows, core.autocrlf would hand that copy
# CRLF line endings even though the repository stores LF, so every consumer
# would have to re-normalize by hand (World of Rolara did, on 2026-08-02).
# Pinning eol=lf makes the checked-out file byte-identical to the stored one on
# every platform, which is what makes the copy safe to ship.
professor-orb/workflows/*.mjs eol=lf
